<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Lwimbu Lwaluwera Luheri</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Lwimbu Lwaluwera Luheri</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lwimbu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lwimbu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitatabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt">LWIMBU LWALUWERA LUHERI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Lwimbu lwaluwera luheli ndo shitabu sha shitakulira mafiru ga wantu wa Israeli, iwezekanika shilembitwi na wantu wavuwa. Kwa shiebrania shisoweru ashi 'Lwimbu lwaluwera luheli,' ama mfalumi gwa wafalumi, ndo lwimbu lwana mana kuliku nyimbu zimonga ama mfalumi gwa wafalumi woseri, shitabu shanja kwa kumkanta mfalumi sulemani, kumbiti shitabu ashi shimaniziya kuwera yomberi ndo yakashilembiti, shipandi sha kwanja mstali gwa kwanja. Viravilii shitabu ashi shilembitwi na muntu yumonga su kumpanana ligoya mfalumi Selemani. Wasomi wamaniti kuwera shitabu ashi shilembitwi pakati pa shinja sha miatisa na sabini na miatisa na selasini na moja K.K na shilembitwi kayi weli lishaka limonga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha lwimbu lwaluwera luheri shitakulira mafiru ga mdala na mpalu, shitabu shoseri shitakulira mpalu na mdala ntambu yawalifira, lishaka limonga maganja walaviya matakulu na kuwera pamuhera mumsambu gwa kuliya, shipandi sha kwanja na mstali gwa nani. Wasomi wavuwa wajimira kuwera mlandu mkulu mushitabu ashi gwa mushipandi sha nani mstali gwa tatu mpaka gwa saba. Mumistali ayi mdala katakula hangu ''ufiru wana makakala handa kuhowa.'' Ufiru ndo shintu shana makakala nentu sheni shiwera mumoyu na sheni shilewelekandiri ndo handa kuhowa. Pamonga ayi ndo mana mdala kabeleziya mala ntatu handa wantu na wimusiya ufiru pamberi pa shaka shakuyi, shipandi sha pili mstali gwa saba na shipandi sha tatu mstali gwa mhanu na shipandi sha nani mstali gwa msheshi. Ufupiziwu wa yagawera amu io Litawu lya shitabu lya mushipandi sha kwanja msitali gwa kwanja io Litawu lya shitabu ashi lilembitwi mushipandi sha kwanja sha lwimbu alu. Shipandi sha kwanja msitali gwa pili mpaka shipandi sha pili msitali gwa saba io Shipandi sha pili sha lwimbu alu. Sha mushipandi sha pili msitali gwa nani mpaka shipandi sha tatu msitali gwa mhanu io Shipandi sha tatu sha lwimbu alu sha mushipandi sha tatu mstali gwa sita mpaka shipandi sha mhanu io Shipandi sha msheshi sha lwimbu alu sha mushipandi sha mhanu msitali gwa pili na shipandi sha sita msitali gwa tatu io Shipandi sha mhanu sha lwimbu alu sha mushipandi sha sita msitali gwa msheshi na shipandi sha nani msitali gwa msheshi.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha sita sha lwimbu alu sha mushipandi sha nani msitali gwa mhanu mpaka shipandi sha nani msitali gwa kumi na nne</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Alu ndo lwimbu luherepa lwa Selemani.<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa kwanja</para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />Shondi gunoneri kwa mlomu gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">mana ufiru waku unemiziya kuliku divayi.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />Utuli waku ununkira weri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">na litawu lyaku ndo handa utuli wawumiminitwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">Toziya ayi wakawali wakufira!<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />Guntoli, tugendi zyetu kalongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">mfalumi kanjega mushumba shakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Hatusekeleri na kufyapilira toziya yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">hatuzyumi mafiru gaku kuliku divayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Hangu ndo mana wadala wakufira!<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />Mwenga wahinga wa Yerusalemu, neni namtitu kumbiti herepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">namtitu handa malingu ga Kedari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">handa mapaziya ga liringu lya Selemani.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Namnkangasha toziya namtitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">mana mshenji gununguziya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Walongu wangu wankalalaliti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">na wantenda mlolera gwa malambu ga mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Kumbiti ndekiti kulilolera lirambu lyangu lya mizabibu.<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />Gung'ambiri gwee yanikufira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">haguwaliyiziyi koshi kondolu waku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Na pamberi mshenji hagweni kalipi hawoyeri koshi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Ntambu gaa neni nikusakuli pakati pavipinga vya wayagu?<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />Gwee yaguherepa kuliku wadala woseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">handa guvimanandiri pahala pa kumpata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">Gufati maleka ga kondolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">guwaliyiziyi wambuzi waku wadikawadika pakwegera na malingu ga washungaji.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />Gwee yanikufira nikufaniziya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">na farasi gwashidala yawakwega mbutuka za nkondu za falawu.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />Hereni ziheripiziya sheni shaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">na singu yaku ifiriziya kwa mikufu ya mabuhi ga beyi nkulu.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />Hatukunyawiri hereni zya zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">yazilembeziwitwi kwa feza.<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />Shaka mfalumi pakaweriti pameza pakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">utuli wangu ununkira pahala poseri.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />Yanimfira ndo handa lipaki lya linunkila kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">pakagonja pashifuwa pangu.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />Mfiru gwangu ndo handa uluwa wa mtera yawubuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">mu malambu ga mizabibu aku Engedi.<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />Nakaka gwenga guherepa, mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">nakaka guherepa na masu gaku gang'ereng'eta kwa ufiru.<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />Nakaka guherepa gwenga yanikufira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">guherepa nakaka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Pahala panu pa mihambi miwisi hapaweri shitanda shetu,<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />mitera ya muwanga hayiweri mpanda za numba yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">na midenki hayiweri litala lyakuyi.<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />Neni na uluwa wa kulawa Sharoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">uluwa wa kululalanda.<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />Handa uluwa pakati pa misontu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">ndo ntambu yakawera yanimfira pakati pa wakawali.<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />handa mtera gwa mpera pakati pa mitera ya kuntundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">ndo ntambu yakawera yanumfira pakati ya wantemba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">Nsekelera kulikala palisisi lyakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">na kuwera pakwegela na neni ndo handa kuliya libwajubwaju linoga.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />Kantoliti mpaka paligeleri lwa msambu gwa kuliya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">na kila muntu mekawoni handa yomberi kanfira neni.<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />Gumpanani likakala kwa zabibu ziyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">na kunemiziyi kwa libwajubwaju lyawalishema matofaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">mana mafiru gantenda ndwali.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />Mtuyi gwangu gugonjera liwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi lya mfiru gwangu liweriti msagamu gwa mtuwi gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">na liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu linkisikira.<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />Mwenga wahinga wa Yerusalemu niwalagalira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">mlirapi kwa neni kwa makakala ga wanjapuli ama wafyembi wa kuntundu, namkwankanira pota kwimusiya mafiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">mpaka shaka shakuyi pashisoka.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 2:7">Lwimbu lwa pili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="SNG 2:7">Mdala<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />Mpikinira liziwu lya mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">pakiza, nakugulukaguluka kumigongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">na kutuga kumigongu.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />Mfiru gwangu ndo handa fyembi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">ama shinjapuli mwana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">Kagoloka pakwegera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">na shibambaza sha twenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">na kasungulira mulidirisha pakafira kulola munumba.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />Mfiru gwangu kang'ambira.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 2:10">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">su gugoloki, gwenga yanikufira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">gwizi tugendi zetu.<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />Guloli shaka sha mpepu shipita kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">na mvula zileka kala,<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />uluwa ubuma kila pahala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">Na shaka sha kwimba shisoka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">liziwu lya ng'unda lipikanika mumalambu mwetu.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Mtera gwa mtini gwanja kulera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">na mizabibu ibuma na kulaviya nunkira iherepa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">Gwizi su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">gwenga yanikufira, gwizi tugendi.<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />Gwenga ndo handa ng'unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">yagulififiti mumatalabuwi. Gunanguziyi sheni shaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">na nilipikiniri liziwu lyaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">mana liziwu lyaku liherepa na sheni shaku shiherepera.<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />Kwana wantu wamonga wa handa wavibweta wadikawadika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">yawahalibisiya mizabibu yetu yayibuma, naguwaleka wankomangi.<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />Gwenga gwamfiru gwangu na neni namfiru gwaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">Yomberi kaliyiziya kondolu wakuyi pauluwa wa yungiyungi,<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />Pamberi mshenji gwenilawi na luwindu kuwuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">guwuyi mfiru gwangu, guweri handa fyembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">ama shinjapuli mdidini pampindi pa migongu ya Beteri.<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />Pashiru paweriti pashitanda shangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">nimsakuliti mpalu ulii yanimfira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">kumbiti nimpatitindiri. <verse eid="SNG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />Shakapanu nilitakulira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">“Hanimuki na kumsakula mpalu gwangu munjira na paluwaga na kumjini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">na pamajojoniru ga wantu, nimsakuliti gwangu yulii gwa moyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">kumbiti nimpatitindiri.” <verse eid="SNG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />Walolera wa kumji wamoniti pawaweriti wamulihengu lyawu lya kulolera kumjini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">Su niwakosiya, “Hashi mumuwona yanimfira mpaka kumoyu?”<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />Katepu pandekaniti nawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">nimwoniti yanimfira mpaka kumoyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">Nimkoliti pota nimlekandiri kawuki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">mpaka panimpelekiti ukaya kwa mawu gwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">na mpaka kushumba kwa mawu yakaniwuliti.<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />Niwabeliziya mwenga wahinga wa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">mlirapi kwa neni kwa makakala ga wanjapuli ama wafyembi wa kuntundu, namkwankanira pota kwimusiya mafiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">mpaka shaka shakuyi pashisoka.<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lya tatu</para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />Gaa ayu yakiza kulawa kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">handa liwundi lya lyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">na yakanunkira utuli kulawa kwa yawushuwuza? <verse eid="SNG 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Guloli ndo Shiti shakuyi sha ukulu sha Selemani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">shashipapitwi na vikambaku sitini wa Israeli.<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />Woseri waweriti na magumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">woseri wavimaniti ntambu ya kulikoma nkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">magumba gawu gaweriti kala kwa kutendera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">waweriti kala kwa makomangu ga pashiru.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Mfalumi Selemani kalinyawiriti shiti shakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:9">kwa mbawu ziherepa kulawa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />Mpanda zakuyi za kulongolu mwashiti gagubikirwa kwa madini ga feza, mpanda za kumberi zya shiti zigibikirwa kwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">shiti shakuyi shilembitwi kwa nguwu za zambalawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">wadala wa Yerusalemu ndo yawasoniti kwa ufiru na kushigibikira.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Mwenga wadala wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">mwizi mumloli mfalumi Selemani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">Kavalira lijenjeri lyakavalisiwitwi na mawu gwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">lishaka lyakayugiti na lishaka lyakanemereliti.<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="s">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />Gwee yanikufira, guloli ntambu yaguherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">nakaka gwenga guherepa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Masu gaku gaherepa gagibikwa na mtandiwu gwa shela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">viri zaku zivina gambira shipinga sha mbuzi shashiselera kulugongu lwa Gileyadi. <verse eid="SNG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />Menu gakuyi mafufu handa shipinga sha kondolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">yawalimbatulitwi mibahira vinu na kugululwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">Kila yumu kalela wawili na kwahera yoseri yakaweriti gweka yakuyi. <verse eid="SNG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />Miromu yaku ndo handa ubunta msheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">mlomu gwaku guherepa. Sheni shaku shiherepa, masaya gaku handa vipandi viwili vya libwajubwaju lyawalishema komamanga. <verse eid="SNG 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />Singu yaku iherepa handa shindwalingu sha Dawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">shashinyawitwi weri, su kutulirwa vintu vya kulikomangira elufu vya vikambaku. <verse eid="SNG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />Maweri gaku gaherepa handa vinjapuli wawili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">yawaliyiziwa pa uluwa wa yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Hanilikali kulugongu lwana utuli ununkira na hang'endi kulugongu lwana ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">mpaka pawushiya na lidunyu kuwuka. <verse eid="SNG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />Guloli ntambu yaguherepa gwee mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">gwenga gwahera shidoda shoseri.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />Gwee mdala gwangu gwa ndowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">gwizi tugendi pamuhera na neni kulawa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Guseleri kulawa kulugongu lwa Amana na kulawa pampindi pa lugongu lwa Seniri na Herimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">lweni simba na duma walikala kumpanga.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />Gwee mfiru gwangu na mdala gwangu, yanikufira nentu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">neni mbezandiri kukuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">mana pagundola hera mona ukufu musingu yaku.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />Gwe mfiru gwangu na mdala gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">ufiru waku kwaneni ungangasha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">nemelera ufiru waku kuliku kulanda divayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">nunkira ya utuli waku upita utuli wa kila ntambu.<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />Gwee mdala gwangu, miromu yaku itulusiya lwashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">lulimi lwaku lwana lwashi na maweri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">Nguwu zyaku zinunkira weri handa mitera ya miyerezi kulawa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />Gwee mfiru gwangu na mdala gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">gwenga ndo handa bostani kwa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">gwenga ndo linegu lya mashi lyaligibikitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">gwenga ndo mbwiru ya mashi yayizyengetirwitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">su wantu wamonga nawalanda mashi.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />Gwenga gwa handa bostani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">yayimemiti mitera ya makomamanga, yagana mabwajubwaju ganoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">viraa kwana mitera ya hina na nado,<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />na mitera ya Nado na Zafarani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">mshai na mdalasini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">mitera yayinunkira na udi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">na vimeru vimonga yavyana nunkira iherepa.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />Gwenga ndo handa bwiru kubostani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">na gwa handa linegu lya mashi gaherepa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">na vishemba vyaviselera kulawa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />Guvumi gwee lyega lya kushana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">gwizi gwenga lyega lya kusika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">muvumi pabostani yaneni na kulimemiziya lyera kwa utuli wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Yanimfira kizi mubostani mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">kaliyi mabwajubwaju gakuyi ganoga kuliku goseri.<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />Gwee mfiru gwangu na mdala gwangu niza mubostani yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">njojonira lipaki lyalinunkira na viwungu vyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">ndiya lisega na lwashi lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">nanda divai na maweri,</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 5:1">Wamaganja</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">mliyi na kulanda mwawaganja waneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">mlandi nentu mwee wafiru wangu.<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa msheshi</para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />Nsinditi kugonja, mana moyu gwangu guweriti gwankulihola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Shakapanu mpikinira mfiru gwaneni kankukota mlyangu,</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:2">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">mfiru gwaneni, gumvuguliri mlyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">gwenga ng'unda gwangu yagwahera shidoda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Mtuyi gwangu gulowa mangami</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">na viri zangu zilowa lufolafola lwa pashiru.<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />Nilitakulira kuwera, “mvula kala nguwu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">hashi nvali kayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">Nawa kala magulu gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">hashi nigadodisiyi kayi?”<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />Mfiru gwangu kabatiti mlyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">na moyu gwangu guweriti na matamata toziya kaweriti pakwegera.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />Nimukiti kumvugulira mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">mawoku gangu gamema utuli ununkira wa manimani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">vyala vyangu vitulusiya utuli ununkira wa manimani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">pankoliti shigobeku kuvugula mlyangu.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />Nimvuguliriti mlyangu mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">kumbiti yomberi kawukiti kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Moyu gwangu gutwezukiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nimsakuliti, kumbiti nimpatandiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">na nimshemiti kumbiti kanitikirandiri.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Walolera wa muji wamoniti pawaweriti mulihengu lyawu lya kulolera kumjini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">wankomanga na kuntenda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">na walolera wa ligomi likulu wampoka shela yangu.<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />Niwaluwani mwenga wadala wa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">pamumwona mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">mumgambiri handa mafiru gantenda ndwali!<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Wadala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />Gwenga yaguherepa kuliku wadala woseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">Hashi mfiru gwaku kana shintu gaa shimonga kuliku wamonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">mpaka gutuluwi kwa kutuzyangazyanga hangu?<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />Mfiru gwangu kaherepa na kana makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">na kamanika kuliku wapalu elufu kumi.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />Mtuyi gwakuyi guherepa handa zahabu iherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">viri zakuyi ndo zilinyengeta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">na ntitu pii handa kungulu.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />Masu gakuyi mafufu handa ng'unda pampeku pa lushemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">yawamogiziyiti mu maweri yakaherepa gambira mabuhi ga beyi nkulu.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />Masaya gakuyi ndo bostani ya mitera yayinunkira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">nunkiru yakuyi ndo handa utuli wa manimani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">Miromu yakuyi handa uluwa wa yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />Mawoku gakuyi ganyawa weri handa luhonga lwa zahabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">na gagibikwa na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">Nshimba yakuyi ing'eleng'eta handa magoli ga ntembu yagalembiziwitwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">na madini ga buluu.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />Magulu gakuyi handa supa yayinyawitwi kwa mabuwi ga alabasta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">zyazigolosiwitwi mumiyanjiru ya zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">Kawonekanika gambira lugongu lwa Lebanoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">yagwana mitera ya miyerezi.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />Mlomu gwakuyi gumema visoweru vinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">nakaka yomberi ndo kaherepa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Hangu ndo ntambu yakawera mfiru gwangu, yina ndo ntambu yakawera ganja gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">mwee wadala wa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="sp">Wadala wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />Gwee mdala yaguherepa nentu kuliku wadala wamonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">kagenda koshi mfiru gwaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">kagenda njira gaa mfiru gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">su tugendi na gwenga kukutanga kumsakula?<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />Mfiru gwangu kagenda kubustani yakuyi peni viwungu vimera weri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">yomberi kagenga kuliyiziya kondolu wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">Kagenda aku kukagula na kujojonira uluwa wa yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />Neni namfiru gwakuyi na yomberi ndo mfiru gwagu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">yomberi kankuwaliiziya wakondolu wakuyi pahala pana uluwa wa yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa mhanu</para>
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />Mfiru gwangu, gwenga ndo guherepa handa mji gwa Tiriza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">gwenga ndo guherepa handa isi ya Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">gwenga gutiliziya handa lishonta lyana bendera.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />Nagundola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">mana pagundola mona soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">Vili zaku handa shipinga sha mbuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">yawaselela kumigongu ya Gileyadi.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />Menu gaku mafufu nentu handa shipinga sha kundolu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">yawalawiti kugululwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">Kila yumu kana wana wawiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">kwahera ata limu yalilifanandiri na limonga.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />Masaya gaku yagagibikiritwi na shela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">ndo handa vipandi viwiri vya makomamanga.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Paweza kuwera na malikiya sitini, wadala wamonga semanini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">na wahinga yawawalangikandiri!<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />Kumbiti kwana mdala yumu hera yanimfira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">yomberi ndo mfiru gwa mawu gwakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">na kagweka yakuyi kwa mawu gwakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Wahinga wamlola na wamshema katekelerwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">malikiya na wadala wamonga pawamwona wimba zyuma zyakuyi.<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />Gaa ayu yakalawira handa mandawira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">kaherepa handa lyezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">na kang'ereng'eta handa mshenji.<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />Ng'enditi kubostani ya mitera ya milozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kulola ntomolu zya kululalanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kuwona handa mizabibu itomola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">ama mikomamanga ibuma uluwa.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />Pamberi hanenevimani shanashilawiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">mfiru gwangu kanshema mumbutuka ya mkulu.<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Wadala wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 6:13" />Guvini, guvini gwee mhinga kulawa Shulami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Guvini su tukuloli ntambu yaguvina.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 6:13">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Hashi mfira kundola neni mshulami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">handa kulola wantu wankuvina msambu gwa manahimu?<verse eid="SNG 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />Gwee mhinga gwa mfalumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">guloli ntambu yagafiriza magulu gaku muvirwatu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Magulu gaku gana maringu handa mabuhi ga beyi nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">lihengu lya mawoku ga fundi yakamanika.<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />Shitovu shaku gambira bakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">yeni yikosandiri divayi yayihanganyikiti na mashi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">Mtima gwakuyi handa limatilu lya nganu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">lyalizyengetitwi na uluwa wa yungiyungi.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />Maweri gaku gawoneka handa shinjapuli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">ndo handa fyembi wawili.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />Singu yaku gambira shindwalingu sha magoli ga ntembu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">masu gaku handa litanda kumji gwa heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">pakwegera na ligomi lya Beti Rabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">Mpula yaku gambira shindwalingu sha Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">lweni lugenda kumji gwa Damasku.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />Mtuwi gwaku mkulu handa lugongu Karimeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">na mviri zakuyi ntali ziherepa handa nguwu ya shifalumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">Uherepa wakuyi uweza kumkwegiziya mfalumi.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />Guloli ntambu yaguherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">Gwee mfiru na mwali yaguherepa!<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />Utali waku ulifana na mtendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">maweri gaku galifana na visanya vya tendi.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />Ntakuliti hanigukweni mtendi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">na kwapa mabwajubwaju gakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">Kwaneni maweri gaku handa visanya vya zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">kupumula kwaku kununkila handa mabwajubwaju.<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />Na mlomu gwaku handa divai inoga.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:9">Mdala gwa ndowa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="SNG 7:9">divayi iseleri mpaka kwa mfiru gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">ipiti pamilomu yakuyi na menu gakuyi!<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />Neni na gwakuyi mfiru gwangu na matamata ga yomberi ndo neni.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />Gwizi mfiru gwangu tugendi mumalambu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">na tukagonji kuvijiji aku.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />Hatwimuki mandawira putiputi, tugendi mumalambu ga mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">twakaloli handa yanja kutomola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">na handa uluwa wa mzabibu ubuma kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">na viraa mikomamanga yanja kulaviya uluwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">Patuwera aku ndo hanikupanani ufiru wangu.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Mavili galaviya nunkila yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">pakwegera na mlyangu gwetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">kwana kila ntambu ya libwajubwaju liherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">goseri ga syayi na ga makashu geni nikutulira gwenga yanikufira neni.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />Handa meguweri mlongu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">mweni kanoniziwa na mawu gwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">Hangu, meniliwoni na gwenga kunja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">menikunoneri na kwahera muntu mekaliholi handa ntenda vidoda.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />Menikulonguziyi na kukufikiziya mpaka ukaya kwa mawu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">kwa yomberi yakafunditi ufiru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">Menikupanani divai iherepa yayigongomolwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">na menikupanani divai yangu ya mabwajubwaju ga makomamanga.<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />Liwoku lyaku lya kumshigi lya pasi pa mtuyi gwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">na liwoku lyaku lya kumliwu linkisikira.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Nikuluwani mwenga, wadala wa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">namsakula mafiru, mpaka shaka shakuyi pashisokaku.<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Lwimbu lya sita</para>
  <para style="s">Wadala wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />Gaa ayu yakiza kulawa kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">agawu kamwegemera mfiru gwakuyi?</para>
  <para style="s" vid="SNG 8:5">Mdala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">pasi pa mtera gwa mtofaa neni nikwimusiyiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">pali peni mawu gwaku kawoniti utama na kwikwiwula.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />Guntuli pakwegera na gwenga handa shimaniziwu mumoyu gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">yina handa shimaniziwu mumawoku mwaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Toziya ufiru wana makakala handa kufuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">weya viraa unaunkesera handa lisembi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Ufiru ulunguziya handa motu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">na gwaka handa mlipulipu gwa motu.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Malawa hapeni gatendi ufiru uperi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">pota nshemba ziwezandiri kuwudibiziya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Handa muntu mekalaviyi lunda yoseri ya ukaya kwakuyi toziya ya ufiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">mekabeziwi nakamu.<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Walongu wa mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />Twana dada mdidini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">mweni kenifunduli maweri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Hatumtenderi shishi dada gwetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">lishaka pawamhetaku?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />Handa mekaweri shibambaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">metumnyawiri shindwalingu sha madini ga feza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">Handa mekaweri mlyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">metutenderi mbawu za miyerezi kumnyawira felemu.<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />Neni weriti handa shibambaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">na maweri gangu handa vindwalingu vyakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Pamasu gakuyi weriti handa yakajega ponga.<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mpalu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Selemani kaweriti kana lirambu la mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">pahala papashemwa Baali Hamoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">Kalaviyiti lirambu kwa walimi wa lirambu lyakuyi lya mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">kila yumu gwawu kalipiti vipandi elufu vya feza.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />Lirambu ali lya mizabibu ndo lirambu lyangu namweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">yina ndo lyangu! Gwenga Selemani gulikali na feza zaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">na kila walolera wa mabwajubwaju kapananwi mia mbili zakuyi.<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />Gwenga yaguwera mulirambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">wamaganja wangu wapikanira liziwu lyaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">guleki na neni mpikaniri liziwu lyaku!<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mdala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />Gwee mfiru gwangu gutugi, kalongola, handa shinjapuli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">gutugi handa fyembi pa migongu yana mitera ya viwungu yavinunkira.<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>